            "category": "workaround",
            "details": "Disable clipboard redirection for RDP connections.\n\nWhen launching sessions with the xfreerdp command-line utility, explicitly disable the clipboard channel:\n```\nxfreerdp -clipboard /v:<server_address>\n```\n\nWhen connecting via graphical clients, disable clipboard synchronization within the respective connection profile preferences.\n\nCaveats:\nDisabling clipboard redirection prevents transferring text, images, or files between the local system and the remote session.\n\nWarning:\nChanges apply to new connections; any active RDP sessions must be disconnected and restarted for the setting to take effect.",
